Awesome ida.  I have them as globals now, but you're right, I can make
them locals and that would be way better.

So I'll plan to incorporate all these ideas.  Thanks much for the
feedback.  It's going to take me a bit of time to do this and
I have some other bugs to get to first, but I'll have it done by
2.7.

This wasn't even originally my idea --- someone else not on the
dev team had suggested instrumenting the code with line numbers
before, but I can't find the earlier post.

- Bob

