If you can manage, though, we don't want to use histograms
for discrete data, but bar plots.  That way, the plots will
be on the numbers, not between them.  Look at the difference
in a simple example and you'll see what I mean.

- Bob

> On Mar 10, 2015, at 1:07 AM, Jonah Sol Gabry <jga...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
