Sure, attached.

I suggest that merges should mostly go in one direction, toward the
'develop' branch. That is, topical branches should rebase on top of
'develop' just prior to being merged to 'develop'. Some exceptions to
this rule are no problem, but the current situation looks more like an
undisciplined free-for-all.

