Subject: New testing framework
Message-ID: <fdjEcdI0Pog.tDRcjgo4SmwJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/fdjEcdI0Pog/m/tDRcjgo4SmwJ>
