Subject: missing data (vs. parameters) in BUGS/JAGS
Message-ID: <AwIxpWlUAo0.ErZ08fSuz9MJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <AwIxpWlUAo0.e8qBFatONg0J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
